+## Defect and fix
+
+Closing the final window in 1.2.1 removed its document from the recovery
+session. File > Exit kept documents, so restoration depended on how the
+application was closed. This reproduced both reported blank-startup cases.
+The new close/restore regression suite fails on the unmodified 1.2.1 code
