+The final window now uses the same Save/Discard/Cancel and session-persistence
+transaction as File > Exit. Closing one of several windows still removes only
+that window from the next session. Close requests are serialized and wait for
+window destruction so rapid closes retain the final document. Closing or
+exiting during startup waits for all restored and requested windows to exist.
+
+The Startup control remains below User Interface. Start New Session continues
+to open a blank document intentionally. AppData profile selection and settings
+are unchanged; no migration or installation is required.
 
